## Dimension 3: Security

### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorization Required — audit trail viewable only by users with appropriate RBAC role; write access restricted to system (not user-initiated)
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption — audit records transmitted over TLS 1.2+
- **SEC-002:** No Secrets in Code — audit store credentials in Azure Key Vault

### Security Requirements
- Audit trail write operations are system-initiated only; no user-facing API to create or modify audit entries
- Audit trail read access restricted to RBAC-authorised roles (e.g. practice manager, compliance officer)
- Audit queries parameterised to prevent injection attacks
- Audit records stored in append-only storage where possible (infrastructure-level immutability)

---

## Dimension 4: Observability & Performance

### Product KPIs
- Audit entry write success rate
- Audit entry write latency (action occurs → audit entry committed)
- Audit query response time
- EMIS Web filing success rate (current architecture)

### Observable Events (OTEL Instrumentation)
- `documents.audit.entry_written` — audit entry successfully committed
- `documents.audit.entry_failed` — audit entry failed to write; error type and action recorded
- `documents.audit.query_executed` — authorised user queries audit trail
- `documents.audit.emis_web_filed` — audit entry successfully filed to EMIS Web

### Performance SLOs
- Audit entry write: p99 < 500ms; p99.9 success rate ≥ 99.9%
- Audit entry write must complete before action response is returned to user (write-before-return)
- Audit query response: p95 < 2 seconds for standard date-range queries

### Alerting Conditions

| Condition | Threshold | Severity | Channel |
|---|---|---|---|
| Audit write failure | Any single audit write failure | CRITICAL | On-call page |
| Audit write latency breach | p99 > 500ms sustained for 1 min | HIGH | Ops alert |
| Audit query latency breach | p95 > 2 seconds sustained for 5 min | MEDIUM | Ops alert |
| Audit entry gap detected | Expected entry count drops for a document action type | CRITICAL | On-call page |

